  ('8mm Pitch Steel Chain Loop (80 Links, 640mm Pitch Length)', '3315-0008-0080', 'A continuous loop chain is helpful when you know exactly the length of chain your project needs. It also saves you the hassle of chain construction! As such, the absence of the unique "master link" you''d need to connect the ends of your chain means that every link is identical. This 8mm pitch steel chain has an impressive 120kg working load: more than triple what #25 (0.250") chain is able to handle! The 8mm pitch of the chain coincides with the 8mm grid used throughout the goBILDA® build…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-chain-loop-80-links-640mm-pitch-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2158/images/11788/3315-0008-0080__06007__99529.1713543580.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain / 8mm Pitch Chain', 'gobilda'),
