  ('8mm Pitch Steel Chain Loop (110 Links, 880mm Pitch Length)', '3315-0008-0110', 'A continuous loop chain is helpful when you know exactly the length of chain your project needs. It also saves you the hassle of chain construction! As such, the absence of the unique "master link" you''d need to connect the ends of your chain means that every link is identical. This 8mm pitch steel chain has an impressive 120kg working load: more than triple what #25 (0.250") chain is able to handle! The 8mm pitch of the chain coincides with the 8mm grid used throughout the goBILDA® build…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-chain-loop-110-links-880mm-pitch-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2163/images/11813/3315-0008-0104__78709.1713364904.1280.1280__43104__50750.1713543761.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain / 8mm Pitch Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('Hitec HS-488HB Servo', '33488', 'The HS-488HB servo is based around the popular HS-485HB but with a few noteworthy changes. To be more compatible with a wider spectrum of the servos and attachments on the market, the HS-488HB has a 25 tooth spline. This makes bulking up supporting parts much easier as you are able to stick to one(1) spline size rather than bouncing back and forth between 24 and 25. The new spline comes with a larger servo screw that has a 2.5mm hex drive rather than a Phillips drive. The HS-488HB also has an…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hitec-hs-488hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1105/images/5498/HS-488HB_No-Horn__49928__91261.1701992552.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Standard Size Servos', 'gobilda'),
  ('Hitec HS-788HB Servo', '33788', 'The Hitec HS-788HB servo is based around the long-time favorite, the HS-785HB. This new model was created with a 25 tooth output spline in order to conform with the majority of the hobby servo market. Similar to its 24 tooth cousin, this model is able to rotate multiple turns while retaining positioning feedback. Conventional servos are typically limited to a maximum of 180 degrees, which, in the steering mechanism of a remote controlled car, is plenty. Many other applications demand more than…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hitec-hs-788hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1124/images/5617/33788S__30163__33182.1701992591.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Large Size Servos', 'gobilda'),
