  ('3404 Series 3mm HTD Pitch Set Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (6mm D-Bore, 18 Tooth)', '3404-1006-0018', 'The 18 tooth set screw pinion pulley has a D-bore to mate to a 5202 Series Gear Motor or 6mm D-shaft. The 15.5mm inside width is compatible with the 15mm width timing belts.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3404-series-3mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-6mm-d-bore-18-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/828/images/4579/3404-1006-0018__25839__33240.1701992238.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
