  ('3405 Series Round Belt (5mm Cord Diameter, 533mm Circumference)', '3405-0005-0533', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3405-series-round-belt-5mm-cord-diameter-533mm-circumference/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/873/images/4745/3405-0005-0533__92433__14104.1701992286.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Round Belts & Pulleys / Round Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('3405 Series Round Belt (5mm Cord Diameter, 573mm Circumference)', '3405-0005-0573', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3405-series-round-belt-5mm-cord-diameter-573mm-circumference/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/874/images/4751/3405-0005-0573__59895__98079.1701992288.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Round Belts & Pulleys / Round Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('3405 Series Round Belt (5mm Cord Diameter, 613mm Circumference)', '3405-0005-0613', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3405-series-round-belt-5mm-cord-diameter-613mm-circumference/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/876/images/4757/3405-0005-0613__65609__94677.1701992290.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Round Belts & Pulleys / Round Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('3405 Series Round Belt (5mm Cord Diameter, 653mm Circumference)', '3405-0005-0653', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3405-series-round-belt-5mm-cord-diameter-653mm-circumference/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/878/images/4762/3405-0005-0653__02175__04484.1701992291.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Round Belts & Pulleys / Round Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('3406 Series 3mm HTD Pitch Timing Belt (15mm Width, 5 Meter Cut-Length)', '3406-0015-0005', 'This five meter section of timing belt is excellent for building XY tables and linear motion systems. In most belt-driven linear motion systems, the belt fastens to the carriage that moves up and down the track, negating the need for the belt to be a continuous loop. The belt is easily cut to length with scissors and then fastened to your assembly using a timing belt clamp.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3406-series-3mm-htd-pitch-timing-belt-15mm-width-5-meter-cut-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1261/images/6253/3406-0015-0005-Ang4__94230__38875.1701992796.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3407 Series Hub-Mount Winch Pulley (Dual Spool, 112mm Circumference)', '3407-0002-0112', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3407-series-hub-mount-winch-pulley-dual-spool-112mm-circumference/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1679/images/8769/3407-0002-0112_Ang1__57222__43737.1701993573.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Cable & Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('3407 Series Hub Mount Winch Pulley (16-1)', '3407-0016-0001', 'This Hub Mount Winch Pulley is able to fasten to any hub or component which possesses the 16mm hub pattern. The pulley is considered a ''dual spool'', meaning it is divided in the middle so you can wind two separate strings independently of one(2) another. Typically one(3) string is wound the opposite direction of the other so that, as the pulley rotates, it lets string out on one(4) side as it winds the string from the opposing side in. This pulley is excellent for creating a power retract in a linear…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3407-series-hub-mount-winch-pulley-16-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1103/images/5489/3407-0016-0001__64266__08085.1701992549.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3408 Series V-Groove Pulley - 2 Pack', '3408-0001-0001', 'Each pack consists of two V-Groove Bearings and two V-Groove Bearing Shields (with shims). This collection of parts is commonly used for rigging linear motion assemblies driven by synthetic cable. The shields help keep your cable on the bearings even if slack is introduced in the line.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3408-series-v-groove-pulley-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1137/images/5704/3408-0001-0001_02__68893__63554.1701992618.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Cable & Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('3mm Pitch HTD Timing Belt Clamp (1-1) - 2 Pack', '3409-0001-0001', 'Timing belt clamps are great for fastening a cut length of belt to put your project in motion. Cut belt lengths, as opposed to continuous belts, are typically used in applications that don''t require them to run over the pulley. For example, an XY table could be driven using a pulley and a cut length of belt. In order to create the motion, the belt will need to be properly tensioned and fastened to the chassis. These clamps will accept a 3mm HTD timing belt, inserted in either orientation. For…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3mm-pitch-htd-timing-belt-clamp-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1238/images/6170/3409-0001-0001__10360__72921.1701992771.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Timing Belt Clamp (3-1) - 2 Pack', '3409-0003-0001', 'This 2mm Pitch GT2 Timing Belt Clamp allows you to attach one(5) end of a cut-to-length belt to the carriage of a linear motion assembly. With both ends of the belt looped around an attachment point on each side of the carriage, a motor-driven pulley can drive the belt to pull the carriage in either direction along its track. This clamp meshes a 2mm GT2 timing belt to itself to create and keep a tight endpoint loop. Its pinch bolt ensures your belt will stay where you put it, and its eyelet…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-timing-belt-clamp-3-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1821/images/9806/Ang1__61772__31219.1701993907.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Belt-Clamp for 2mm Pitch GT2 Timing Belt - 2 Pack', '3409-0004-0001', 'This steel belt-clamp is a simple, no-excuses clamping solution for fastening a 2mm GT2 belt in a linear motion assembly. The steel construction allows for a clinch nut: a captive nut that means this clamp is a one(6)-tool setup that doesn''t leave you fumbling with unnecessary hardware.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-belt-clamp-for-2mm-pitch-gt2-timing-belt-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2180/images/12122/3409-0004-0001_Ang1__78521.1718371072.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('3410 Series Servo Mount Winch Pulley (25T Spline, 38mm Spool Diameter)', '3410-0025-0038', 'This Servo Pulley fits on a 25T spline servo. It is a dual spool pulley meaning that two independent lines can be wrapped so that, as the pulley rotates, it will let line out on one(7) side while reeling it in on the other. This style pulley is commonly found on power retract lifts and many R/C sailboats. As an added bonus, the pulley has the goBILDA 16mm pattern on the face so that additional parts can be attached with ease, or the pulley can be fastened to a hub rather than directly on a servo.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3410-series-servo-mount-winch-pulley-25t-spline-38mm-spool-diameter/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1233/images/6140/3410-0025-0038__92952__14672.1701992762.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3410 Series Servo-Mount Winch Pulley (25T Spline, Dual Spool, 112mm Circumference)', '3410-0025-0112', 'The 25 tooth (H25T Spline) Servo-Mount Winch Pulley pulls its weight in cable-driven assemblies! Thanks to its 112mm circumference dual-spool design, it can simultaneously wind and feed out 112mm (4.4") of string per rev when two strings are attached opposite each other—an essential setup in power retract lifts and R/C sailboats. Attachment holes conveniently placed in both sides and troughs allow for multiple ways to tie up loose ends in pulley-based builds.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3410-series-servo-mount-winch-pulley-25t-spline-dual-spool-112mm-circumference/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1747/images/9233/3410-0025-0112__88289__34291.1701993721.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Attachments', 'gobilda'),
  ('3411 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Aluminum Hub Mount Timing Belt Pulley (14mm Bore, 24 Tooth)', '3411-0014-0024', 'This 5mm HTD pitch timing pulley is able to accommodate 9mm width 5mm pitch timing belt between the flanges. This is the largest diameter of 5mm pulley that''s able to run inside of 1120 Series U-Channel while providing enough clearance for the belt. The 14mm bore is surrounded with the standard 16mm goBILDA pattern so you can install this hub pulley onto a hub.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3411-series-5mm-htd-pitch-aluminum-hub-mount-timing-belt-pulley-14mm-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1303/images/6425/3411-0014-0024_REV1__85999__84744.1701992846.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
