  ('5mm Pitch HTD Timing Belt (9mm Width, 840mm Pitch Length, 168 Tooth)', '3412-0009-0840', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3412-series-5mm-htd-pitch-timing-belt-9mm-width-840mm-pitch-length-168-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1295/images/6394/3412-0009-0840__93234__74464.1701992837.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5mm Pitch HTD Timing Belt (9mm Width, 890mm Pitch Length, 178 Tooth)', '3412-0009-0890', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5mm-pitch-htd-timing-belt-9mm-width-890mm-pitch-length-178-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1297/images/6402/3412-0009-0890__75886__98693.1701992838.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Acetal Timing Belt Idler (6mm ID x 12mm OD, 12mm Width, 1-1) - 2 Pack', '3413-0001-0001', 'This timing belt idler is a very compact solution for adding tension to your timing belt assembly. The inside width was chosen to accept 9mm width timing belts such as our 5mm HTD belts. The bore provides a slip-fit over a 6mm shaft, standoff or spacer.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/acetal-timing-belt-idler-6mm-id-x-12mm-od-12mm-width-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1304/images/6433/3413-0001-0001_Ang3__10377__82583.1701992848.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Acetal Timing Belt Idler (6mm ID x 12mm OD, 18mm Width, 1-2) - 2 Pack', '3413-0001-0002', 'This timing belt idler is a very compact solution for adding tension to your timing belt assembly. The inside width was chosen to accept 15mm width timing belts such as our 3mm HTD belts. The bore provides a slip-fit over a 6mm shaft, standoff or spacer.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/acetal-timing-belt-idler-6mm-id-x-12mm-od-18mm-width-1-2-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1315/images/6484/3413-0001-0002__86707__54947.1701992864.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3414 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Set Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (6mm D-Bore, 16 Tooth)', '3414-1006-0016', 'This product is discontinued. It has been replaced by the 3417-1006-0016. This 16 Tooth, 6mm D-bore pinion pulley is specifically for 5mm HTD belt with a width of 9mm or less. The bore matches the shaft profile of our 5201 and 5202 Series Yellow Jacket Gear Motors as well as our 6mm D-Shafting.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3414-series-5mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-6mm-d-bore-16-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1311/images/6469/3414-1006-0016__91964__04243.1701992860.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3414 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Set Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (8mm REX® Bore, 16 Tooth)', '3414-4008-0016', 'This 16 Tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion pulley is specifically for 5mm HTD belt with a width of 9mm or less. The bore matches the profile of our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. The pair of set screws lock the pulley from moving axially on the shaft.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3414-series-5mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-8mm-rex-bore-16-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1299/images/6409/3414-4008-0016__64805__87607.1701992840.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3414 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Set-Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (8mm REX® Bore, 24 Tooth)', '3414-4008-0024', 'This 24 Tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion pulley is specifically for 5mm HTD belt with a width of 9mm or less. The bore matches the profile of our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. The pair of set screws lock the pulley from moving axially on the shaft.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3414-series-5mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-8mm-rex-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1301/images/6417/3414-4008-0024__26487__62970.1701992843.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3415 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Hub Mount Timing Belt Pulley (14mm Bore, 48 Tooth)', '3415-0014-0048', 'This 48 Tooth Hub Mount Timing Pulley is commonly used in projects that require a reduction of the input speed, yielding an amplified torque output at the shaft or tube this pulley is mounted to. When paired with a 16 tooth pinion pulley, you can achieve a 3:1 ratio. Given the large diameter of the pulley, the contact between the belt and the pulley is maximized so they can handle heavy torque loads with little possibility of skipping or jumping teeth. The pulley has been molded in separate…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3415-series-5mm-htd-pitch-hub-mount-timing-belt-pulley-14mm-bore-48-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1317/images/6492/3415-0014-0048__90982__77315.1701992866.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('3417 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Set-Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (6mm D-Bore, 16 Tooth)', '3417-1006-0016', 'This 16 Tooth, 6mm D-bore pinion pulley is specifically for 5mm HTD belt with a width of 9mm or less. The bore matches the shaft profile of our and 5202 Series Yellow Jacket Gear Motors as well as our 6mm D-Shafting.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3417-series-5mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-6mm-d-bore-16-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1458/images/7281/3417-1006-0016__80906__33647.1701993115.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('3417 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Set-Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (8mm REX® Bore, 16 Tooth)', '3417-4008-0016', 'Engineered specifically for 5mm HTD belts with widths of 9mm or less, this 24 tooth, 8mm REX® bore pinion pulley features a profile-matched bore to create a positive drive, while a pair of set-screws prevent the pulley from moving axially on a shaft. Built-in shims on each side allow the pulley to rest against a bearing while providing clearance between the pulley and the bearing''s outer race. SET-SCREW WITH THREAD-LOCKING NYLON PATCH The set-screw included with this product features a nylon…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3417-series-5mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-8mm-rex-bore-16-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1724/images/9031/3417-4008-0016-Ang1__36001__07074.1701993657.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('3417 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Set-Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (8mm REX® Bore, 24 Tooth)', '3417-4008-0024', 'This 24 Tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion pulley is specifically for 5mm HTD belt with a width of 9mm or less. The bore matches the profile of 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. The pair of set-screws lock the pulley from moving axially on the shaft. Around the 8mm REX® bore are four thru-holes on the goBILDA® 16mm pattern that allow you to attach this pulley to hubs and other components throughout the goBILDA® build system. The hex counterbores can seat nuts and screw heads, which helps…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3417-series-5mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-8mm-rex-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1589/images/8345/3417-1006-0016_Ang1__72766__10134.1701993433.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('3418 Series 5mm HTD Pitch Timing Belt Idler Pulley (6mm Bore, 8 Tooth) - 2 Pack', '3418-0006-0008', 'This idler pulley has a 5mm HTD Pitch timing pulley profile. This feature allows a timing belt to fully mesh with the idler rather than the belt riding on the edges of its teeth. Sold as a 2 Pack.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3418-series-5mm-htd-pitch-timing-belt-idler-pulley-6mm-bore-8-tooth-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1666/images/8703/3418-0006-0008__47065__28999.1701993553.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('3mm HTD Pitch Set-Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (6mm D-Bore, 18 Tooth)', '3419-1006-0018', 'This 18 tooth set-screw pinion pulley has a 6mm D-Bore designed to fit our 6mm D-shaft or a gear motor which has a 6mm D-Shaft output. It is compatible with 15mm wide 3mm HTD timing belt and includes a built-in shim on both sides so that it can run right up against a bearing without the flanges rubbing on the outer race.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-6mm-d-bore-18-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1574/images/8259/3419-1006-0010__13596__56238.1701993407.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Hub-Mount Timing Belt Pulley (14mm Bore, 60 Tooth)', '3421-0014-0060', 'This two-piece, 60 tooth pulley is designed for precise operations with 2mm pitch belts of up to 6mm width. All eight of its thru-holes are on the versatile goBILDA® 16mm square pattern, and four on each side are counterbored to allow screw heads or locknuts to rest below the build surface. This pulley can also hold two bearings to function as a large idler for a 2mm pitch belt. Just fit a pair of 14mm OD flanged bearings flush into its outer counterbores. Alternatively, you can install two…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-hub-mount-timing-belt-pulley-14mm-bore-60-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1817/images/9767/3421-0014-0060__31831__90798.1701993895.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Pinion Timing Pulley (6mm Bore, 20 Tooth)', '3422-0006-0020', 'Punch up the precision with a GT2 Pinion Timing Pulley! Fine-toothed to drive 6mm wide GT2 belt in high-precision applications like printers, sliders, and XY tables, this dual-material pulley rocks steel where you need it—in its flange, and the barrel housing the threads of its set-screw hole—while still feeling slim on the scales due to the remainder of the pulley being aluminum. This 6mm bore pulley can attach to 6mm diameter or 6mm D-profile shafting. It rocks two build-in shims: one(8) on…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-pinion-timing-pulley-6mm-bore-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2122/images/11602/3422-0006-0020__08866.1712343946.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Pinion Timing Pulley (1/8" Bore, 20 Tooth)', '3422-0125-0020', 'Punch up the precision—and the speed!—with this GT2 Pinion Timing Pulley! Fine-toothed to drive 6mm wide GT2 belt, this pulley''s dual-material construction rocks steel where you need it—in its flange, and the barrel that houses the threads of its set-screw hole—while using aluminum in the remainder of the pulley. The 1/8" bore matches perfectly with the 1/8" D-shaft on a 5000 Series motor. The M4 set-screw—which features the thread-locking magic of a nylon patch—interfaces securely with the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-pinion-timing-pulley-1-8-bore-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2449/images/15428/Ang1__35556.1761334465.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Pinion Timing Pulley (8mm REX® Bore, 20 Tooth)', '3422-4008-0020', 'Punch up the precision with a GT2 Pinion Timing Pulley! Fine-toothed to drive 6mm wide GT2 belt in high-precision applications like printers, sliders, and XY tables, this dual-material pulley rocks steel where you need it—in its flange, and the barrel housing the threads of its set-screw hole—while still feeling slim on the scales due to the remainder of the pulley being aluminum. This 8mm REX® bore pulley can attach to 8mm REX® shafting to help you implement positive drive in your precision…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-pinion-timing-pulley-8mm-rex-bore-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2123/images/11600/3422-4008-0020__68330.1712343907.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
