  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Timing Belt (6mm Width, 600mm Pitch Length, 300 Tooth)', '3423-0006-0600', 'This 2mm pitch, 6mm width, 600mm pitch length GT2 timing belt facilitates precise, quiet motion in compact form. ("Pitch length" refers to the circumference of the belt at the pitch line. You can calculate the pitch length by multiplying the pitch by the number of teeth.) Besides providing awesome transfer of rotary motion in intakes and shooters, belts of the 2mm pitch GT2 variety are especially effective as linear motion solutions in precision applications. That includes multi-axis setups…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-timing-belt-6mm-width-600mm-pitch-length-300-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2432/images/15357/3423-0006-0600__79414__37910.1760024412.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Timing Belt (6mm Width, 648mm Pitch Length, 324 Tooth)', '3423-0006-0648', 'This 2mm pitch, 6mm width, 648mm pitch length GT2 timing belt facilitates precise, quiet motion in compact form. ("Pitch length" refers to the circumference of the belt at the pitch line. You can calculate the pitch length by multiplying the pitch by the number of teeth.) Besides providing awesome transfer of rotary motion in intakes and shooters, belts of the 2mm pitch GT2 variety are especially effective as linear motion solutions in precision applications. That includes multi-axis setups…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-timing-belt-6mm-width-648mm-pitch-length-324-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2431/images/15353/3423-0006-0648__77195__27589.1760024398.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Dual Belt, 5mm HTD Pitch, Set-Screw Pinion Timing Belt Pulley (8mm REX® Bore, 16 Tooth)', '3424-4008-0016', 'With a doubled width that multiplies motion possibilities, this 16 tooth, 8mm REX® bore pinion pulley can drive up to two 5mm pitch HTD belts of widths of 9mm or less. It''s a fantastic solution in a skid-steer drivetrain where two centrally-located motors power the chassis via belts extending to the front and back wheels on each side. The pair of set-screws prevent the pulley from moving axially on the 8mm REX® shaft. Built-in shims on each side allow the pulley to rest against a bearing while…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dual-belt-5mm-htd-pitch-set-screw-pinion-timing-belt-pulley-8mm-rex-bore-16-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1993/images/10903/Ang_1__37314__52006.1701994251.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Timing Belt (6mm Width, 5 meter Cut-Length)', '3426-0006-0005', 'This 2mm pitch, 6mm width, 5 meter long GT2 timing belt facilitates precise, quiet motion in compact form. With a whopping 5 meters of belt ready to be cut-to-length, you can measure twice and cut once–and may end up with enough spare belt to drive more than one(9) assembly. While belts are often used as continuous rotating loops, cut-to-length belts are ideal for carrying an object back-and-forth. This is achieved by attaching both of a belt''s endpoints to the carriage.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-timing-belt-6mm-width-5-meter-cut-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1812/images/9742/3426-0006-0005__67215__20290.1701993886.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Belts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Timing Belt Idler for 2mm Pitch GT2, 6mm Width Belt - 4 Pack', '3427-0001-0001', 'This timing belt idler increases the possibilities of a 2mm wide GT2 belt drive assembly by providing a way to change the tension and trajectory of a belt. Its shield ensures that a belt remains in place even if it slackens, while its bearings provide a smooth surface for either the toothed or smooth side of a 6mm wide belt to run with ease.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/timing-belt-idler-for-2mm-pitch-gt2-6mm-width-belt-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1819/images/9791/3427-0001-0001__32174__49441.1701993903.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Timing Belt Idler Pulley for 2mm Pitch GT2, 6mm Width Belt - 4 Pack', '3427-0002-0001', 'This timing belt idler pulley increases the possibilities of a 2mm wide GT2 belt drive assembly by providing a way to change the tension and trajectory of a belt. Its shield ensures that a belt remains in place even if it slackens, while its bearings provide a smooth surface for either the toothed or smooth side of a 6mm wide belt to run with ease.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/timing-belt-idler-pulley-for-2mm-pitch-gt2-6mm-width-belt-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2008/images/10999/Ang1__64049__69851.1701994279.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 2mm GT2 Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley (4mm Bore, 18.5mm Diameter, 9.5mm Inside Width)', '3428-0019-0004', 'This 4mm Bore Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley is constructed of two 4mm bore bearings and a polycarbonate plastic pulley. You can slip it onto an M4 screw or 4mm shaft to change the tension and trajectory of a single timing belt. The polycarbonate plastic pulley provides an ultra-smooth surface for either the smooth or toothed side of a timing belt to run with ease. Its flanges, 9.5mm apart, act as guardrails for belt security. While one(10) bearing is flush with the plastic pulley, the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dual-bearing-timing-belt-idler-pulley-4mm-bore-18-5mm-diameter-9-5mm-inside-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2082/images/11387/3428-0019-0004__29988__76139.1709572458.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley (6mm Bore, 18.5mm Diameter, 9.5mm Inside Width)', '3428-0019-0006', 'This 6mm Bore Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley is constructed of two 6mm bore bearings and a polycarbonate plastic pulley. You can slip it onto a 6mm diameter shaft, spacer, or standoff to change the tension and trajectory of a single timing belt. The polycarbonate plastic pulley provides an ultra-smooth surface for either the smooth or toothed side of a timing belt to run with ease. Its flanges, 9.5mm apart, act as guardrails for belt security. While one(11) bearing is flush with the plastic…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dual-bearing-timing-belt-idler-pulley-6mm-bore-18-5mm-diameter-9-5mm-inside-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2083/images/11392/3428-0019-0006__23852__91886.1709572472.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley (8mm Bore, 18.5mm Diameter, 9.5mm Inside Width)', '3428-0019-0008', 'This 8mm Round Bore Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley is constructed of two 8mm round bore bearings and a polycarbonate plastic pulley. You can slip it onto an 8mm round or 8mm REX™ standoff or shaft to change the tension and trajectory of a timing belt. The polycarbonate plastic pulley provides an ultra-smooth surface for either the smooth or toothed side of a timing belt to run with ease. Its flanges, 9.5mm apart, act as guardrails for belt security. While one(12) bearing is flush with the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dual-bearing-timing-belt-idler-pulley-8mm-bore-18-5mm-diameter-9-5mm-inside-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2088/images/11425/3428-0019-0008__26215__96299__09812.1710447071.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley (8mm REX® Bore, 18.5mm Diameter, 9.5mm Inside Width)', '3428-0019-4008', 'This 8mm REX® bore Dual-Bearing Timing Belt Idler Pulley is constructed of two 8mm REX® bore bearings and a polycarbonate plastic pulley. You can slip it onto an 8mm REX® standoff or shaft to change the tension and trajectory of a single timing belt. The polycarbonate plastic pulley provides an ultra-smooth surface for either the smooth or toothed side of a timing belt to run with ease. Its flanges, 9.5mm apart, act as guardrails for belt security. While one(13) bearing is flush with the plastic…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dual-bearing-timing-belt-idler-pulley-8mm-rex-bore-18-5mm-diameter-9-5mm-inside-width/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2084/images/11397/3428-0019-4008__51170__28225.1709572483.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys / 5mm HTD Timing Belt Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('3500 Series Lead Screw Barrel Nut (8mm Lead, 4 Start, 12mm OD, 16mm Length)', '3500-0804-1216', 'The barrel nut, while simple, is incredibly versatile when paired with a 12mm clamping hub. This two-piece approach allows you to adjust the axial position of the mating component by loosening a single pinch bolt and also allows you to rotate the lead screw nut inside the clamp to achieve the exact position before clamping in place. Pair this with a second lead screw nut and you can clock the barrel nut relative to the other lead screw nut to eliminate backlash.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3500-series-lead-screw-barrel-nut-8mm-lead-4-start-12mm-od-16mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/569/images/3537/3500-0804-1216__19456__22043.1701991927.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Lead Screws / 8mm Lead Screw Nuts', 'gobilda'),
